1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,583
Packing an outdoor bag in Cape Town?

2
00:00:02,583 --> 00:00:05,994
Before you go, run this sunscreen label scavenger hunt.

3
00:00:05,994 --> 00:00:07,234
Five things to find.

4
00:00:07,934 --> 00:00:13,010
Disclosure first: dermatology dot capetown earns a commission if you buy through our

5
00:00:13,010 --> 00:00:13,312
link.

6
00:00:13,312 --> 00:00:18,207
We're not dermatologists or doctors, and this is general product information, not

7
00:00:18,207 --> 00:00:19,113
medical advice.

8
00:00:19,934 --> 00:00:21,544
Find one: the SPF number.

9
00:00:21,544 --> 00:00:25,922
Our example, clearing defense SPF thirty, puts it right in the name.

10
00:00:26,622 --> 00:00:28,886
Find two: the words broad spectrum.

11
00:00:28,886 --> 00:00:34,125
The product page describes broad spectrum sunscreen that defends against UV rays.

12
00:00:34,825 --> 00:00:36,759
Find three: the active filters.

13
00:00:36,759 --> 00:00:39,815
Here they're listed as homosalate, eight percent.

14
00:00:39,815 --> 00:00:41,499
Octocrylene, eight percent.

15
00:00:41,499 --> 00:00:43,059
Octisalate, five percent.

16
00:00:43,059 --> 00:00:44,930
And avobenzone, three percent.

17
00:00:45,630 --> 00:00:47,227
Find four: the directions.

18
00:00:47,227 --> 00:00:52,324
Apply a generous amount to cleansed face and neck, preferably thirty minutes before

19
00:00:52,324 --> 00:00:54,842
sun exposure, and reapply as recommended.

20
00:00:55,603 --> 00:00:57,146
Find five: who it suits.

21
00:00:57,146 --> 00:01:01,582
It's a shine-reducing, matte SPF moisturiser for breakout-prone skin.

22
00:01:01,582 --> 00:01:06,918
The page also notes very dry skin may feel drier, and suggests layering a hydrating

23
00:01:06,918 --> 00:01:08,076
lotion underneath.

24
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:09,621
Five for five?

25
00:01:09,621 --> 00:01:12,801
Then it goes in the bag, along with a hat and some shade.

26
00:01:13,501 --> 00:01:17,836
It's linked at dermatology dot capetown, and we earn a commission on purchases

27
00:01:17,836 --> 00:01:18,836
through that link.

28
00:01:18,836 --> 00:01:20,948
Subscribe for the next scavenger hunt.
